# Bundled submodules as path, owner/repo and commit, parents before their children. Upstream's
# macOS CI builds N64Recomp (the recompiler, which also provides the runtime's mod loader) at
# a13e5cff rather than the N64ModernRuntime submodule's c1a6dc93, which fails on the patches.
# DXC, Vulkan-Headers, VulkanMemoryAllocator and zstd come from MacPorts; the Windows-only
# submodules (D3D12MemoryAllocator, mupen64plus-win32-deps, freetype-windows-binaries) are left
# out.
set submodules {
